{"id":"prepositions-0039","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 39","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s keen ___ joining the photography club.","hint":"keen ___ sth/doing","explanation":"keen ON something/doing something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":["by","on","in","at"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The film is based ___ a true story.","hint":"based ___","explanation":"\u0027Based on\u0027 = developed from."},{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Over two hundred athletes participated ___ the marathon.","hint":"participate ___ sth","explanation":"participate IN an event (also: take part in)."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":["from","of","with","by"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She suffered ___ migraines for years before the surgery.","hint":"suffer ___ an illness","explanation":"\u0027Suffer from\u0027 an illness or condition."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"It never occurred ___ me to check the address.","hint":"occur ___ sb (come to mind)","explanation":"it occurred TO somebody = they thought of it."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The minister refused to comment ___ the scandal.","hint":"comment ___ sth","explanation":"comment ON a topic."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Who is responsible ___ locking up?","hint":"responsible ___ sth","explanation":"responsible FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The government imposed new restrictions ___ water use.","hint":"restrictions ___ sth","explanation":"restrictions ON something."}]}